MANIFOLD_PROJECT_API project(self) -> manifold3d.CrossSection

Returns polygons representing the projected outline of this object
onto the X-Y plane. These polygons will often self-intersect, so it is
recommended to run them through the positive fill rule of CrossSection to get
a sensible result before using them.
CROSSSECTION_API Two-dimensional cross sections guaranteed to be without self-intersections, or overlaps between polygons (from construction onwards). This class makes use of the [Clipper2](http://www.angusj.com/clipper2/Docs/Overview.htm) library for polygon clipping (boolean) and offsetting operations.
